# Build output and its incremental state. `pnpm build` regenerates both inside the image,
# so shipping a host copy in only makes the context bigger and the COPY layers churn on
# changes the image never sees.
dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Nothing below is copied into any stage; excluding it keeps the context transfer, which
# happens once per image, down to what the build reads.
